  "title": "Two Mugs",
  "summary": "The texter says Cody has been shouting on the wharf that \"the Pellerin lady\" thinks he's a killer, and that the wrong person might hear. Then they slip and sign a message \"J.\", the way June did, and apologise. Tess realises June must have texted this person often. Bree comes back with the notebook where she kept her own counts. On the four December Tuesdays initialled B.L., she was at her nursing practicum in Bridgewater, and Tuesday is Paul's order day.",
